---
import Prose from '../layouts/Prose.astro';
import Discoveries from '../islands/Discoveries';
import { creatorsFor, getGame } from '../lib/content/load';
import { DISCOVERY_FEED } from '../config';
const game = getGame('gta-vi');
const creators = creatorsFor(game.id);
---
<Prose title="Updates" current="updates" description="What's new on Nerdy Birdie Gaming.">
  {DISCOVERY_FEED && (
    <Discoveries client:load heading="What's New from creators" sections={game.guideCategories.map((c) => ({ id: c.id, label: c.label }))}
      guidesHref={`/games/${game.id}/guides/`} />
  )}
  {DISCOVERY_FEED && creators.length > 0 && (
    <section class="creators" aria-labelledby="creators-h">
      <h2 id="creators-h">Creators we follow</h2>
      <p class="small muted">We check these YouTube channels every day for new GTA VI videos. All credit for their videos goes to them.</p>
      <ul>
        {creators.map((c) => (
          <li><a href={`https://www.youtube.com/channel/${c.channelId}`} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{c.name}<span class="sr-only"> (YouTube channel, opens in a new tab)</span></a>
            <span class="muted"> {c.handle}</span><br /><span class="small muted">{c.focus}.</span></li>
        ))}
      </ul>
    </section>
  )}
  <h2>24 November 2026 · Preview 7</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Walkthrough: all 68 story missions in Chapters 1–3, in story order, each with a spoiler-free objective, key steps, choices and missables. Plot details stay behind Reveal.</li>
    <li>Chapter 1 missables: 11 items, outfits, a unique revolver and three side missions you can lose for good, plus a warning about money before Chapter 2.</li>
    <li>What counts toward 100%, the 481 collectible cards, beginner tips and the Malibu Club easter egg.</li>
    <li>Sources: IGN's GTA 6 guide and GTA Series Videos, linked on every entry.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>24 November 2026 · Preview 6</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>What's New from creators: a daily check for new GTA VI videos from the creators we follow (GTA Series Videos, MKIceAndFire and TGG), shown here and in the matching guide sections. Titles and videos stay hidden until you choose to see spoilers, and nothing counts toward your progress.</li>
    <li>ASK "COZMC" can point you to the right creator for walkthroughs, money, vehicles, secrets and tips.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>24 November 2026 · Preview 5</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>ASK "COZMC": ask a question in your own words and get a short answer from our guide, with a link to the map or checklist.</li>
    <li>Flashing arrows to the COZMC Discord and cozmc.us.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>24 November 2026 · Preview 4</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Leonida map with search, filters, shareable pin links and mark-as-found, shared with the guide checklists.</li>
    <li>Creator videos from YouTube, Twitch and TikTok, opening at the right moment. Nothing loads until you press play.</li>
    <li>"Continue where you left off" on the home page.</li>
    <li>New Nerdy Birdie and COZMC brand artwork.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>24 November 2026 · Preview 3</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>First real guide entries, from Rockstar's official pages: platforms, Leonida's regions, the main characters (spoiler-gated), editions, GTA+ perks and the GTA+ Elegy.</li>
    <li>Every entry shows whether it's Confirmed, Unconfirmed or a Rumor, with its sources and the date they were last checked.</li>
    <li>Search and filter guide entries by section, spoiler level and verification. Progress by section on My Progress.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>24 November 2026 · Preview 2</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>New retro arcade look.</li>
    <li>Ranks, checkpoints at 25/50/75/100%, and "Next up" suggestions (missable items first).</li>
    <li>Quest board with ten guide sections. Every guide is a checklist, every fact links to its source, and videos only load when you press play.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>24 November 2026 · Preview</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>GTA VI platforms confirmed from Rockstar's launch announcement: PlayStation 5 and Xbox Series X|S.</li>
    <li>Achievement and trophy tracker built: separate Xbox and PS5 lists, spoiler-free by default, saved on your device, backup and restore.</li>
    <li>The achievement and trophy lists themselves are not published yet. They'll appear once verified.</li>
  </ul>
</Prose>
<style>
  .creators { margin: 0 0 28px; }
  .creators ul { padding-left: 1.2em; }
  .creators li { margin: 6px 0; }
</style>
